+"""Tests for the Exp6124 V531 transition receipt.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-REPORT-6124,
+SCENARIO-REPORT-6124-ACTIVATED-MATRIX,
+SCENARIO-REPORT-6124-TERMINAL-CLASSES,
